WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:02.150
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:08.759
The atom bomb, hydrogen bomb, nuclear bomb,
whatever you want to call it, is the single

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:16.020
most destructive thing humanity has ever created,
one nuclear device could flatten a city the

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.439
size of London.

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:23.789
And the United States of America has lost
eight of them.

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:29.550
Permanently misplaced, these estranged nuclear
warheads are called "broken arrows" by the

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.550
Department of Defense.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:31.609
How does the world's largest superpower lose
over 1,000 kilograms of nuclear explosives,

00:00:31.609 --> 00:00:32.609
eight times?

00:00:32.609 --> 00:00:35.590
The first was lost on February 13th, 1950.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:42.840
A B-36 bomber was flying from Alaska to Texas,
it lost power and began to free-fall.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:48.710
To prevent the bomb from detonating when the
plane crashed he dropped the payload, a Fat

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:52.820
Man nuclear bomb into the Pacific Ocean.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:58.620
Submarine search teams were dispatched to
find it, but it was never located and to this

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:05.100
day, one of the world's most powerful nuclear
bombs remains undetonated, somewhere at the

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.700
bottom of the Pacific.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:14.800
Another two bombs with a combined yield of
3.4 megatons went missing in 1956, when a

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.440
B-47 left from Florida.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:22.110
Whilst traveling over the Mediterranean sea,
through thick fog, it went missing, it was

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:26.770
never heard from again, the nuclear weapons
were never found.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:32.780
Another went missing in a swamp, another bomb
rolled off a US navy vessel just off the coast

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:37.650
of Japan, which Japan weren't too pleased
about, to say the least.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:43.670
And another two were lost at sea when a US
submarine mysteriously sank along with all

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.450
99 crewe members.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:52.120
But whilst America has been busy losing nuclear
warheads, Russia were hard at work building

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.120
them.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:02:02.369
At the height of the cold war, in 1985, the
Soviet Union had a terrifying 39,197 nuclear

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:11.019
weapons, many more than the count of America's
peak stockpile of 31,139.

00:02:11.019 --> 00:02:18.110
It has often been said that nuclear war is
madness and mad it is.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.110
M.A.D.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:22.269
as in Mutually Assured Destruction.

00:02:22.269 --> 00:02:27.060
The only thing that has so far prevented the
end of the world.

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:32.519
A doctrine of war that means if one side uses
their full nuclear arsenal on the other, then

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:38.840
the other side will automatically use their
nuclear arsenal upon the attacker in response,

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:44.650
therefore wiping out both countries.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:49.010
It is based on the Nash equilibrium, which
dictates that when both opponents possess

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:55.189
the same strategy, neither side has anything
to gain by using their strategy and therefore

00:02:55.189 --> 00:02:58.159
the best course of action is to do nothing.

00:02:58.159 --> 00:03:05.640
And so the world is frozen in a constant state
of being on the brink of blowing each other

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:06.640
up.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.810
But how did it come to this?

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:14.749
Fleeing persecution from the Nazi regime,
many Jewish scientists fled to the West during

00:03:14.749 --> 00:03:20.299
the early days of the war, including highly
influential physicists such as Albert Einstein,

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:24.299
Hans Bethe, Edward Teller and John von Neumann.

00:03:24.299 --> 00:03:29.980
Most of them joined the Manhattan project,
a brand new, top-secret program between United

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:37.749
States, United Kingdom and Canada with one
primary goal, to invent the atomic bomb.

00:03:37.749 --> 00:03:43.409
The enormous project employed 130,000 people
and cost the US the modern-day equivalent

00:03:43.409 --> 00:03:46.840
of $25 billion dollars.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:52.989
Just three years after the project was established
the US detonated the world's first ever nuclear

00:03:52.989 --> 00:03:55.849
weapon in the New Mexico dessert.

00:03:55.849 --> 00:03:59.909
It was codenamed Trinity.

00:03:59.909 --> 00:04:05.349
They didn't waste any time and just three
weeks later they detonated a Uranium bomb

00:04:05.349 --> 00:04:10.810
over Hiroshima, killing over 140,000 people.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:15.309
In the bloody aftermath of the war there was
a twilight struggle between the Communist

00:04:15.309 --> 00:04:22.160
Soviet Union and Capitalist America to gain
control of and shape how the post-world war

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.810
would look.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.780
Russia had also gone nuclear and the arms
race had begun.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:32.919
An arms race that would last 44 years, this
was the Cold War.

00:04:32.919 --> 00:04:37.759
It was the ultimate contest of might and each
side went to extraordinary lengths just to

00:04:37.759 --> 00:04:40.460
prove they were the most endowed country.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:46.870
The USA seriously considered a plan to airdrop
enormous condoms labelled "Medium" into the

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:54.300
USSR to demoralise the Soviets and give the
impression that Americans had a greater "manhood".

00:04:54.300 --> 00:05:00.460
The US also developed a top secret plan to
detonate a nuclear bomb on the moon as a display

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:06.319
of military prowess but it was a tad too expensive.

00:05:06.319 --> 00:05:11.970
So when that didn't work out, they created
project Acoustic Kitty.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:18.590
The CIA implanted microphones attached to
a radio transmitter inside cats.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:29.319
The plan was to use cats to spy on the Kremlin,
but during the very first test, the cat was

00:05:29.319 --> 00:05:35.680
accidentally run over by a car, so that threw
a spanner of doubt into the general reliability

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:40.189
of spy cats and the Acoustic Kitty program
was scrapped.

00:05:40.189 --> 00:05:48.699
The tension grew until it all came to a climax
during the most intense and uncertain 13 days

00:05:48.699 --> 00:05:52.870
of the Cold War, the Cuban Missile Crisis.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:59.240
October 16th 1962, Russia gets a bee in its
bonnet over ballistic missiles that America

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:07.030
had deployed in Italy and Turkey, conveniently
in easy reach and pointed right at the USSR.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:13.030
Russia responded by placing a bunch of their
nuclear weapons in Cuba, in frightfully close

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:19.139
proximity to the US, giving Russia the opportunity
to destroy any number of American cities with

00:06:19.139 --> 00:06:20.840
ease.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:27.669
During these nail-biting thirteen days the
world was closer to complete nuclear annihilation

00:06:27.669 --> 00:06:29.889
that it has ever been.

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:35.229
Eventually an agreement was reached between
John F. Kennedy and Khrushchev that both parties

00:06:35.229 --> 00:06:41.030
would dismantle and remove their respective
weapons from, Italy, Turkey and Cuba.

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:48.740
But what few people know is that during the
Cuban Missile Crisis we came just a hairsbreadth

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:56.259
from total nuclear annihilation, because of
three men in a submarine.

00:06:56.259 --> 00:07:00.870
During the crisis Kennedy put a blockade on
all sea traffic to Cuba to prevent Russia

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:05.090
from delivering even more nuclear weapons
to the small island nation.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:10.599
But a Soviet submarine is hiding, deep in
the Caribbean sea around Cuba.

00:07:10.599 --> 00:07:16.070
US navy vessels pick it up on their radars
and start dropping depth charges to the left

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:19.990
and right of the submarine, to try and deter
it back to Russia.

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:25.370
The sub is violently shaking, the on-board
temperature rapidly rising, a decision has

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:27.449
to be made quickly.

00:07:27.449 --> 00:07:31.941
The sub hadn't made contact with Russia for
several days, they were too deep for their

00:07:31.941 --> 00:07:38.900
communications to reach the surface, they
had no idea what was going on above the water.

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:44.330
Completely in the dark, the three Soviet submarine
commanders on board the vessel came to the

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:49.509
conclusion that full-scale nuclear war had
erupted above the surface.

00:07:49.509 --> 00:07:55.470
They thought World War III was underway, hence
the aggression they were receiving.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:08:01.479
Little did the Americans know that this submarine
was equipped with an enormous nuclear torpedo,

00:08:01.479 --> 00:08:08.110
capable of wiping out a nearby fleet of US
destroyers or an entire city.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:12.360
One of the submarine captains proclaimed "We're
gonna blast them now!".

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:17.520
They readied the nuclear torpedo and their
hand was hovering over the red button.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:24.419
If they had fired the nuclear weapon, it would
have lead to a chain of events that would

00:08:24.419 --> 00:08:31.009
have actually caused full-scale nuclear war
and the end of the world.

00:08:31.009 --> 00:08:39.450
But they didn't fire the nuclear torpedo because
of the calm temperament one man, Vasili Alexandrovich

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.560
Arkhipov.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:46.760
Soviet submarines were only allowed to fire
their nuclear weapons if all three on-board

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:51.120
commanders agreed to do so, unanimously.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:56.790
The other two commanders had agreed to fire
and were pushing Vasili to acquiesce, but

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.450
he would not.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:03.850
He believed this was not an attack but just
a not-so-subtle way of America telling them

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.010
to get away from Cuba.

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:13.090
He remained calm and talked down the other
two commanders, saving the world.

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:20.140
These instances aren't as rare as you might
hope, in total, there have been 13 events

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:26.760
were nuclear weapons were nearly launched
due to accidents or false alarms.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:31.200
But why is nuclear war MAD?

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:35.540
Why does Mutually Assured Destruction have
to be the only way?

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:40.290
Is it not possible that America could use
their full nuclear force on Russia's nuclear

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:46.400
facilities in a pre-emptive strike, completely
wiping Russia off the map before they even

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.810
have a chance to retaliate?

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.810
Or vice-versa?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:55.530
Well, at the height of the cold war Russia
feared this very scenario and America had

00:09:55.530 --> 00:10:00.630
begun to develop sophisticated anti-ballistic
missile systems that could detonate Russian

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:04.850
missiles at altitude, way before they hit
their target.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:13.780
Russia didn't like this, so they developed
the ultimate weapon, a world destroying weapon

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.980
that would leave no survivors, The Doomsday
Device.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:22.950
The Soviet Union created the largest nuclear
bomb in history.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:30.100
Named Tsar Bomba, the "King of Bombs", it
was tested in 1961 in the wilds of Siberia.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:37.530
It had 1,600 times the combined power of the
bombs that were dropped on Hiroshima and Nagasaki.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:44.400
Even the soviets were surprised by how immensely
powerful the blast was, it destroyed an entire

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.610
nearby village, flattening stone houses.

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:52.470
And it shattered windows a thousand miles
away in Finland and Norway.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:56.370
But Nikita Khrushchev wasn't satisfied.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:11:02.880
It's no use having the world's most powerful
weapon if nobody is left alive to use it.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:08.790
So he came up with a plan, a real life doomsday
device that Dr. Strangelove would be proud

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.790
of.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:15.790
The plan was to take a large cargo ship and
turn the entire vessel into a nuclear bomb.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:21.080
The entire cargo hold would be filled with
fissionable radioactive material, it would

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:28.080
be many times more powerful than the Tsar
Bomba and truly powerful enough to destroy

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.320
the entire planet, all on its own.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:35.690
It would permanently circle the coastline
of Russia and onboard sensors would detect

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.130
radiation levels.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:43.510
If at any point extremely high radiation was
detected, indicating Russia had been hit with

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.710
a nuclear weapon.

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:51.740
The ship would automatically, with no human
intervention, detonate itself, destroying

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.480
the planet.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:59.020
It was completely automated and would ensure
that even if no Russian was left alive that

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:04.420
they would still have the last laugh by killing
everything.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:10.240
What a truly terrifying prospect, luckily
Russian scientists managed to persuade Khrushchev

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:12.080
to drop the idea.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.470
It never went ahead.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:21.030
But another plan did, a real doomsday device
that still exists today.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:27.030
Dr Strangelove may have been fictional, but
the Doomsday Device is very real and it's

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:34.180
called "Russia's Dead Hand" because even when
Russia is dead, they can still play their

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:35.180
hand.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:37.710
The system was code-named "Perimeter".

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.140
Thousands of sensors were placed all around
Russia.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:47.150
These sensors measure seismic activity, light
levels, radioactivity, overpressure and sound

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:48.290
levels.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.930
All this is fed back to underground computers.

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:58.700
The data is crunched and if the data suggests
that Russia has been hit by a nuclear blast

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:02.810
the system automatically activates itself.

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:08.790
Once activated the Dead Hand system sends
a signal to every missile silo in the country

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:16.210
and they will automatically and instantaneously
fire at every major city around the world,

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.100
but mostly America.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:23.310
Absolutely no human interaction is needed
for the system to function.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:30.910
This seems pointless and totally excessive
but it serves a very important function.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:36.250
It is the only real deterrent that can stop
America from launching a pre-emptive strike

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:43.230
on Russia's nuclear facilities and heads of
government, disabling their retaliation abilities.

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:51.170
So in a twisted way, the world's most chilling
device is actually the only thing saving us

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.170
all.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:53.330
The scariest part?

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:59.870
You would think such a system would have been
turned off at the end of the Cold War, but

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:06.120
high-ranking Russian insiders have reported
that the system is still fully functional

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.430
and remains activated today.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:14.850
But Russia committed the cardinal sin of a
Doomsday system, they forget to tell anyone.

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:21.050
Russia kept the existence of their Dead Hand
top secret for years, until a high-ranking

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.240
official leaked knowledge of it in the 90s.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:29.830
And in the words of Dr. Strangelove "The whole
point of the doomsday machine is lost, if

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:44.250
you keep it 
a secret!"

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.300
Thanks for watching.

